%% One rep, step by step — what happens in under a second
sequenceDiagram
    participant You as You exercising
    participant Cam as Camera
    participant App as Workout buddy
    participant Voice as Spoken cue
    You->>Cam: Bend knees, then stand
    Cam->>App: Joint angles, every frame
